WEBVTT

00:09:59.037 --> 00:10:01.912
Dallas McGlaughlin started building
websites as a teenager

00:10:02.121 --> 00:10:05.579
and taught himself how to do SEO
search engine optimization.

00:10:06.121 --> 00:10:09.579
You know, when you direct people doing
Google searches to a particular website,

00:10:09.746 --> 00:10:11.996
like what? Those pop up ads
you're always avoiding.

00:10:12.579 --> 00:10:16.537
Dallas got so good at SEO Marketing that
he dropped out of music college to do

00:10:16.537 --> 00:10:19.871
it full time and for a few
years that's what he did.

00:10:20.662 --> 00:10:23.454
But when Dallas decided he wanted
to work for a big agency,

00:10:23.746 --> 00:10:26.621
not having a formal degree became
a major disadvantage.

00:10:26.954 --> 00:10:29.246
It meant nobody was looking
at his resume and

00:10:29.871 --> 00:10:33.954
prescreening tools and technology that
just siphoned me or filtered me out.